  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nIs there a way we could possibly get Language & Region under \"Your preferences\" separated from each other?\n\nI would prefer to have the region set to my local time (in order to more easily view the release time in the integrated calendar) but have English as the app language... there's nothing wrong with the localized language (Swedish) but it's way easier to manage the app using the FAQ and online support when language is set to English  :-)\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
